{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-categorical-q-connection-exists","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:categorical-q-connection-exists","kind":"proposition","title":"Existence of the categorical $q$-connection","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-q-connection","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-categorical-connection-exists","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-substrate-parameter"],"proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-categorical-q-connection-exists"],"tags":["existence","q-connection"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.CategoricalQConnection.exists","text":"categorical-q-connection-exists.md","leanSource":"categorical-q-connection-exists.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:categorical-q-connection-exists\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\mathbf{C}, A, \\tau)</code> be a quantum observable universe, with <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbf{C}</code> linear over the Laurent ring <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">R_q</code>, and let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q \\in R_q</code> have inverse <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q^{-1}</code>. Given morphisms</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\nabla \\colon A \\to A \\otimes \\Omega^1, \\qquad\n  \\iota_\\xi \\nabla \\colon A \\to A, \\qquad\n  \\theta_\\nabla \\colon A \\to A \\otimes \\Omega^1,</code></pre>\n<p>define</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\nabla_q \\;:=\\; q^{-1}\\,\\nabla \\;+\\; (1 - q^{-1})\\,(\\iota_\\xi \\nabla \\mathbin{;} \\theta_\\nabla) \\colon A \\to A \\otimes \\Omega^1 .</code></pre>\n<p>Then these data assemble into a <a href=\"#def:categorical-q-connection\">categorical <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-connection</a> whose <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-connection morphism is <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\nabla_q</code>.</p>\n<p>The existence is by construction: <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\nabla_q</code> is defined by the formula above. That <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\nabla</code> is a categorical connection in the sense of <a href=\"#prop:categorical-connection-exists\" data-at=\"quantum-universes/qu-structures\">3.6.2</a>, and any property of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\nabla_q</code> beyond its formula, are not part of this statement.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-q-connection-exists.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"4.19.4","page":"b/prop-categorical-q-connection-exists","qa":{"counts":{"pass":91,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":13,"unknown":0,"stale":80},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":1}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.CategoricalQConnection.exists","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-q-connection-exists.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
